              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nya 32:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia akawasikiliza, akawaonyesha nyumba yote yenye vitu vyake vya thamani, fedha, na dhahabu, na manukato, na marhamu ya thamani, na nyumba yenye silaha zake, na vitu vyote vilivyoonekana katika hazina zake. Wala hapakuwa na kitu asichowaonyesha Hezekia, katika nyumba yake, wala katika ufalme wake wote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Isaya nabii akamwendea mfalme Hezekia, akamwambia, Wasemaje watu hawa? Nao wametoka wapi kuja kwako? Hezekia akasema, Wametoka katika nchi iliyo mbali, yaani Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo akasema, Wameona nini nyumbani mwako? Hezekia akajibu, Vitu vyote vilivyomo nyumbani mwangu wameviona; hapana kitu nisichowaonyesha katika hazina zangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
